[OC]|cffffcc00Check:|r the log now carries Word to Ironforge (98300), Sully Balloo's Letter (637, if you took it), Horrors in the Highland (95646), Bloom of the Heavens (98209, for Thundris in Auberdine), Highland Hides (98815), shaman Call of Water (94500) and, if you took it, Gleaning Our Future (98310: Golm's heart by Hervdana's cave is still missing, chapter 22). If you will not run the Stockade a second time, abandon The Fury Runs Deep [QS378]. Level 30 spells: Darnassus trainers, next chapter
